2.) THE HTTPS AND THE WEB : 

HTTP : HyperTextTransferPrototcol.
HTTP is an application layer protocol that allows web - based applications to communicate and exchange data.

It is the messanger of the web
Used to deleiver content like images, text, data etc

Three Important things about HTTP : 
1. It is connectionless i.e after making the request, the clinet disconnects form the server, then when the response is ready,the cliend reconnects and delivers the response.

2. The HTTP Can deliver an sort of data as long as both the computers are able to read it.

3. The HTTP is stateless i.e The client and the sever knows about each other just during the current request, if disocnnected
then they need to establish a new connection and provide information again.

